---

<section class="hero" id="hero">
  <div class="container hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <span class="status-dot"></span>
      <span class="status-text">disponível para oportunidades</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="hero-name">Nicolas</h1>

    <p class="hero-role">
      Backend Developer
      <span class="role-stack">· Java & Spring Boot</span>
    </p>

    <p class="hero-description">
      Desenvolvedor Backend focado em Java e Spring Boot. Construo APIs REST,
      modelagem de bancos de dados e integrações entre sistemas, buscando código
      simples, testável e fácil de manter.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a href="#projects" class="btn-primary">ver projetos</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-ghost">entrar em contato</a>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-socials">
      <a
        href="https://github.com/DevNic0las"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="social-link"
      >
        <svg
          width="18"
          height="18"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="currentColor"
          aria-label="GitHub"
        >
          <path
            d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.032 1.531 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z"
          ></path>
        </svg>
        GitHub
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://linkedin.com/in/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="social-link"
      >
        <svg
          width="18"
          height="18"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="currentColor"
          aria-label="LinkedIn"
        >
          <path
            d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 01-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 112.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"
          ></path>
        </svg>
        LinkedIn
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-grid-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding-top: 5rem;
  }

  .hero-grid-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(var(--border) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, var(--border) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 64px 64px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 70% 70% at 50% 50%,
      black 0%,
      transparent 100%
    );
    opacity: 0.35;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .hero-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .status-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #4ade80;
    animation: pulse 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0%,
    100% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    50% {
      opacity: 0.4;
    }
  }

  .status-text {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .hero-name {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 6rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .hero-role {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-weight: 300;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .role-stack {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .hero-description {
    max-width: 480px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 0.65rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--text-primary);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .btn-ghost {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 0.65rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition:
      border-color 0.2s,
      color 0.2s;
  }

  .btn-ghost:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-hover);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .hero-socials {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .social-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .social-link:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
</style>
